---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About">
  <main class="flex-1 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 w-full">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-8">Hey there!👋</h1>
    
    <article class="prose prose-lg dark:prose-invert max-w-none text-justify">
      <h2>💻</h2>
      <p>
        I'm Akhil Panchal, a Software Engineer by profession, driven by the challenge of making technology feel effortless.
        I aspire to enable humans around me to improve their experience with technology.
      </p>

      <h2>🎤</h2>
      <p>
        I occasionally lend my voice to music projects, collaborating with other musicians 
        on original tracks and recording live covers. Check out my <a href="/music">music page</a> for more.
      </p>

      <h2>🥾</h2>
      <p>
        When I'm not at the keyboard, you can find me hiking, backpacking, running and cracking the best/worst puns (depends on how you see it), any chance I get.
        I love exploring the outdoors and challenging myself physically.
      </p>
    </article>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>